{"2984450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Story Page", "steam_appid": 2984450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The Story Page&quot; offers you to plunge into the atmosphere of medieval fantasy filled with role-playing elements. You will have to engage in various activities, ranging from fishing and farming, to managing taverns, castles and even entire cities. Economic mechanisms are waiting for you, allowing you to build your own business in this world. Or maybe you will choose the path of a mercenary or become part of the city guard? Or perhaps you are interested in criminal activity? Here you are free to choose and create characters using flexible settings to enjoy life in this amazing world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This project is an MMORPG in an open world with public servers, but with the possibility of a cooperative experience (small groups of friends can create their own lobbies without connecting to the servers). My goal is to combine the role–playing component with dynamic battles, where the players themselves influence the development of the plot and the course of events. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NPC's daily routine</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each NPC has a daily routine for his life. They work, sleep, relax, communicate with each other, and react to the actions of the player and creatures aggressive to them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984450/extras/c3e926a930e93eeb855e7f911f42efb5.poster.avif?t=1784583735\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984450/extras/c3e926a930e93eeb855e7f911f42efb5.webm?t=1784583735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984450/extras/c3e926a930e93eeb855e7f911f42efb5.mp4?t=1784583735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Magic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy your enemies with rare and powerful magic. The variety will surprise you: from a simple fireball to a sphere that slows down time inside itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984450/extras/f3313410fa33d2005eb8d595ce06e9d1.poster.avif?t=1784583735\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984450/extras/f3313410fa33d2005eb8d595ce06e9d1.webm?t=1784583735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984450/extras/f3313410fa33d2005eb8d595ce06e9d1.mp4?t=1784583735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight with your friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game combines the ability to connect to shared servers, as well as a separate cooperative game for those who want to play only with friends and do not want to see other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984450/extras/dede4e01e6579a00617b7d1f7b2a8f51.poster.avif?t=1784583735\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984450/extras/dede4e01e6579a00617b7d1f7b2a8f51.webm?t=1784583735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984450/extras/dede4e01e6579a00617b7d1f7b2a8f51.mp4?t=1784583735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cooking and crafting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extract resources, grow, collect and create new items from meat stew to elegant sword.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984450/extras/345bb30d123461341c0e28654ede3181.poster.avif?t=1784583735\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984450/extras/345bb30d123461341c0e28654ede3181.webm?t=1784583735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984450/extras/345bb30d123461341c0e28654ede3181.mp4?t=1784583735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dialogues</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dialog system with the possibility of various ramifications and response options</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984450/extras/0908a6b373a4e6f966be8c59377f6697.poster.avif?t=1784583735\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984450/extras/0908a6b373a4e6f966be8c59377f6697.webm?t=1784583735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984450/extras/0908a6b373a4e6f966be8c59377f6697.mp4?t=1784583735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Trading</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade with other players and NPCs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984450/extras/2dee12969c77d6dfe46f2c7e56fa7cc1.poster.avif?t=1784583735\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984450/extras/2dee12969c77d6dfe46f2c7e56fa7cc1.webm?t=1784583735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984450/extras/2dee12969c77d6dfe46f2c7e56fa7cc1.mp4?t=1784583735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The Story Page&quot; offers you to plunge into the atmosphere of medieval fantasy filled with role-playing elements. You will have to engage in various activities, ranging from fishing and farming, to managing taverns, castles and even entire cities. Economic mechanisms are waiting for you, allowing you to build your own business in this world. Or maybe you will choose the path of a mercenary or become part of the city guard? Or perhaps you are interested in criminal activity? Here you are free to choose and create characters using flexible settings to enjoy life in this amazing world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This project is an MMORPG in an open world with public servers, but with the possibility of a cooperative experience (small groups of friends can create their own lobbies without connecting to the servers). My goal is to combine the role–playing component with dynamic battles, where the players themselves influence the development of the plot and the course of events. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NPC's daily routine</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each NPC has a daily routine for his life. They work, sleep, relax, communicate with each other, and react to the actions of the player and creatures aggressive to them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984450/extras/c3e926a930e93eeb855e7f911f42efb5.poster.avif?t=1784583735\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984450/extras/c3e926a930e93eeb855e7f911f42efb5.webm?t=1784583735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984450/extras/c3e926a930e93eeb855e7f911f42efb5.mp4?t=1784583735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Magic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy your enemies with rare and powerful magic. The variety will surprise you: from a simple fireball to a sphere that slows down time inside itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984450/extras/f3313410fa33d2005eb8d595ce06e9d1.poster.avif?t=1784583735\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984450/extras/f3313410fa33d2005eb8d595ce06e9d1.webm?t=1784583735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984450/extras/f3313410fa33d2005eb8d595ce06e9d1.mp4?t=1784583735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight with your friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game combines the ability to connect to shared servers, as well as a separate cooperative game for those who want to play only with friends and do not want to see other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984450/extras/dede4e01e6579a00617b7d1f7b2a8f51.poster.avif?t=1784583735\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984450/extras/dede4e01e6579a00617b7d1f7b2a8f51.webm?t=1784583735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984450/extras/dede4e01e6579a00617b7d1f7b2a8f51.mp4?t=1784583735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cooking and crafting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extract resources, grow, collect and create new items from meat stew to elegant sword.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984450/extras/345bb30d123461341c0e28654ede3181.poster.avif?t=1784583735\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984450/extras/345bb30d123461341c0e28654ede3181.webm?t=1784583735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984450/extras/345bb30d123461341c0e28654ede3181.mp4?t=1784583735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dialogues</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dialog system with the possibility of various ramifications and response options</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984450/extras/0908a6b373a4e6f966be8c59377f6697.poster.avif?t=1784583735\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984450/extras/0908a6b373a4e6f966be8c59377f6697.webm?t=1784583735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984450/extras/0908a6b373a4e6f966be8c59377f6697.mp4?t=1784583735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Trading</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade with other players and NPCs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984450/extras/2dee12969c77d6dfe46f2c7e56fa7cc1.poster.avif?t=1784583735\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984450/extras/2dee12969c77d6dfe46f2c7e56fa7cc1.webm?t=1784583735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984450/extras/2dee12969c77d6dfe46f2c7e56fa7cc1.mp4?t=1784583735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "An indie Online RPG game set in an open world from a solo developer. Create your own character, immerse yourself in an exciting story, engage in various activities: from fishing and farming, to managing industries and cities.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, German, French, Italian, Spanish - Spain, Polish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984450/2813f6e23fe6c034df2261bc763d070e36474c91/header.jpg?t=1784583735", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984450/f3706b909b76ae834a07a0e02eed54a04ba0aa98/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784583735", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984450/f3706b909b76ae834a07a0e02eed54a04ba0aa98/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784583735", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10-11 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 10400F / AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><l